    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Choose two LoRA files from models/loras and the Anima model files. Record opens the imported session without a live mod or editor file. Write edits the left side through the mask. Source files are never written. Export saves a plain LoRA under models/kilora/exports; routing is not kept and the report gives SVD residuals. The Write report feeds the unused new_id input so export waits until Write finishes. For Settings, use the imp- session ID from the report (or leave mod empty when only one session is loaded). edits=off restores the imported LoRAs exactly. Keep controller=r1 until Rprop acceptance passes."
   ]
